# GRU512/768 Muon capacity V3 profile-only packet

This successor preserves V2's seed, clean fold, objective, sampler, model widths, and profile shapes. It fixes physical-GPU selection/telemetry, source-qualified fit verification, separate trainer-saved checkpoint identity, and Kaggle transport. Initial authorization is profile-only; no fit can start from the pending receipt. This local private-dataset staging has not been uploaded or pushed.

The small Kaggle codefile verifies the exact private source-dataset manifest, materializes the packet under `/kaggle/working`, then imports the worker from that verified directory. Raw train/valid and fold0 assets remain separate mounted datasets; the source dataset contains only packet files.
